  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Expression Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Museo de la Palabra y la Imagen (MUPI) in collaboration with community organizations, will bring rural areas exhibits and film forums on migration, women&apos;s issues, environmental concerns, and other topics and will train residents to manage exhibits and develop materials for them. It will evaluate the impact of migration-related programming on the likelihood of young adulsts migrating and will collaborate with diaspora organizatiosn on cultural events in the U.S. The work will benefit 3,600 rural Salvadoreans directly, 10,000 indirectly, and should strenthen UPI as an institution.</narrative>
  </description>
